cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "fraud-synth-bench: Reproducible fraud-analytics research on synthetic data"
abstract: >-
  A seeded synthetic transaction generator with pluggable fraud scenarios, drift
  schedules and label delay, plus a pre-registered comparison of classic and modern
  fraud-detection models under extreme imbalance, concept drift, ring fraud, label
  delay and investigator capacity limits.
type: software
